  "plain": "In 1996, people in the Brazilian town of Varginha say a strange creature, an alien being, was seen and taken away. A man named Carlos Dosoza, speaking with podcast host Jesse Michels, says a small dirt road near the site leads straight to EsSA, the Brazilian army's school for training sergeants. He says he didn't know this himself: a man named James Fox and others who study UFOs told him, and the point is that it would put the army right next to where the being was found."
